SUMMARY:🔥🦁Lions Gate Portal Sound Healing Journey 🦁🔥
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n**An annual astrological event that occ
 urs when the Sun is in Leo (the sign represented by the lion) and the star
  Sirius rises in the sky\, aligning with the Earth and Orion's Belt. This 
 event typically peaks on (8/8) and is believed to be a time of increased c
 osmic energy\, and spiritual awakening.**\n\n🦁**Lions Gate Portal Sound
  Healing Journey-Manifest Your Dreams Here with active Prayer and Sound He
 aling**\n**What is Lions Gate Portal:** An annual astrological event that 
 occurs when the Sun is in Leo (the sign represented by the lion) and the s
 tar Sirius rises in the sky\, aligning with the Earth and Orion's Belt. Th
 is event typically peaks on August 8th (8/8) and is believed to be a time 
 of increased cosmic energy\, spiritual awakening\, transformation\, A time
  when the fixed Star Sirius rises\n\n**⭐Sirius Rising**: Sirius\, the br
 ightest star in the night sky\, becomes visible again after a period of be
 ing hidden by the Sun’s glare. In ancient Egypt\, this event was associa
 ted with the flooding of the Nile and considered a time of rebirth and ren
 ewal.\n\n**8️⃣Numerology**: The date 8/8 is considered significant in 
 numerology\, where the number 8 represents balance\, infinite loops\, and 
 the manifestation of abundance and power.\n\n**↩️Energetic Gateway**: 
 The alignment is believed to open a powerful energetic gateway that enhanc
 es spiritual insights\, personal growth\, and the ability to manifest inte
 ntions.\n\n**We will begin** by honoring this celestial event by setting o
 ur intentions for manifesting our wishes\, dreams\, and desires into a slo
 w burning altar allowing our intentions to be blessed by the sun and fire\
 , then we prepare to somatically integrate our intentions into a somatic s
 ound healing experience that will permeate your entire being\, Then\, Then
  a 44 minute sound journey begins with gongs\, crystal bowls\, chimes\, ha
 nd pan\, kalimba\, crystal triangles including many hand held healing inst
 ruments that will be hovered over your body for personal alchemization. Af
 ter the journey lands\, we will share experiences and seal it with an offe
 ring to the sun.\n\n**David Heiss** specializes in Self-Discovery using so
 und alchemy though blending unique sounds with instruments including many 
 gongs\, crystal bowls\, and other abstract sounding pieces creating a abst
 ract symphony of sound overtones to create a healing restorative experienc
 e. Being an Evolutionary Astrologer\, he offers natal chart readings to as
 sist in your self-discovery process as he has used these divine arts in hi
 s own healing process with results. He has been working with stars and sou
 nds\, AKA Gongs and Astrology since 2012. His intention is to create a spa
 ce through sound to help you realize more of who you are.\n**What do we do
  during a sound healing?** Just lay down or sit and meditate on the sounds
 . Let them take you on a journey into your own being. A time to relax into
  yourself. It's a right brain\, passive experience that lasts about 1 hour
 .\nCheck David's offerings and other events here:\ns[www.Starsounds.love](
 https://www.starsounds.love/)\n\nDonations start at $33 Give what you can\
 , if you would like to attend and need special lower pricing\, Please reac
 h out to David at [david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love) we
  will accommodate\nPRE-REGISTER HERE:[Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.
 love/event-details/lions-gate-portal-sound-healing-journey-2)\n\n**What to
  bring bring** a pad or mat\, pillow\, water bottle\, and or anything to b
 e comfortable. Optional\, something for the Alter.\n\n**🔥🦁See You he
 re🦁🔥**
